TEXT("---\n\n")
TEXT("## FlowGraph Text Format Guide\n\n")
TEXT("When generating FlowGraph files, follow these rules strictly:\n\n")

TEXT("### File Structure\n\n")
TEXT("```\n")
TEXT("FlowGraphExport v1.0\n")
TEXT("WorldBound: true/false\n")
TEXT("ExpectedOwnerClass: None or /Script/Module.ClassName\n")
TEXT("---\n\n")
TEXT("[NODES]\n")
TEXT("Node: GUID\n")
TEXT("  Type: /Full/Path/To/NodeClass\n")
TEXT("  Properties:\n")
TEXT("    PropertyName: value\n")
TEXT("  InputPins:\n")
TEXT("    - PinName [PinType]\n")
TEXT("  OutputPins:\n")
TEXT("    - PinName [PinType]\n")
TEXT("---\n\n")
TEXT("[CONNECTIONS]\n")
TEXT("SourceGUID.SourcePin -> TargetGUID.TargetPin\n")
TEXT("---\n")
TEXT("```\n\n")

TEXT("### Property Format Rules (CRITICAL)\n\n")
TEXT("Unreal Engine uses a specific property text format. **DO NOT use JSON syntax!**\n\n")

TEXT("#### Arrays\n")
TEXT("- **Format**: `(element1,element2,element3)`\n")
TEXT("- **NOT**: `[element1, element2, element3]`\n")
TEXT("- No spaces after commas\n")
TEXT("- Use parentheses `()`, not brackets `[]`\n\n")

TEXT("#### Structs\n")
TEXT("- **Format**: `(Field1=Value1,Field2=Value2)`\n")
TEXT("- **NOT**: `{Field1: Value1, Field2: Value2}`\n")
TEXT("- Use `=` for assignment, not `:`\n")
TEXT("- Use parentheses `()`, not braces `{}`\n\n")

TEXT("#### Array of Structs\n")
TEXT("- **Format**: `((Field1=Val1,Field2=Val2),(Field1=Val3,Field2=Val4))`\n")
TEXT("- Outer parentheses for array, inner parentheses for each struct\n\n")

TEXT("#### TInstancedStruct (e.g., DataPinValue)\n")
TEXT("- **Format**: `PropertyName=/Script/Module.StructType(Field1=Value1,Field2=Value2)`\n")
TEXT("- **Must use full struct path**: `/Script/Flow.FlowDataPinValue_Text`\n")
TEXT("- **NOT short name**: `FFlowDataPinValue_Text`\n\n")

TEXT("#### NamedProperties Example (FlowNode_DefineProperties)\n")
TEXT("```\n")
TEXT("NamedProperties: ((Name=\"PropName\",DataPinValue=/Script/Flow.FlowDataPinValue_Text(Values=(\"text value\"))))\n")
TEXT("```\n\n")

TEXT("#### Common Property Types\n")
TEXT("- **Boolean**: `true` or `false` (lowercase)\n")
TEXT("- **Integer**: `42`\n")
TEXT("- **Float**: `3.14`\n")
TEXT("- **String**: `\"quoted text\"`\n")
TEXT("- **Name**: `UnquotedName`\n")
TEXT("- **Text (FText)**: `\"quoted text\"`\n")
TEXT("- **Text (FFlowDataPinValue_Text)**: `(Values=(\"quoted text\"))` - **IMPORTANT: Must use Values array wrapper!**\n")
TEXT("- **Object Reference**: `/Full/Path/To/Asset.Asset`\n")
TEXT("- **Enum**: `EnumValueName`\n\n")

TEXT("### Pin Declaration\n\n")
TEXT("- **Exec pins**: `- PinName [Exec]`\n")
TEXT("- **Data pins**: `- PinName [TypeName]` (e.g., `[Text]`, `[Vector]`, `[Int]`)\n")
TEXT("- Dynamic data pins are created automatically when referenced in connections\n\n")

TEXT("### Connection Format\n\n")
TEXT("- **Format**: `SourceNodeGUID.SourcePinName -> TargetNodeGUID.TargetPinName`\n")
TEXT("- Works for both exec and data pins\n")
TEXT("- Pin names are case-sensitive\n\n")

TEXT("### AddOn Format\n\n")
TEXT("AddOns are instanced sub-objects that extend the behavior of a node. They appear inside a node block, after its pins.\n\n")
TEXT("```\n")
TEXT("Node: <GUID>\n")
TEXT("  Type: /Game/Path/To/FN_SomeNode.FN_SomeNode_C\n")
TEXT("  Properties:\n")
TEXT("    SomeProperty: value\n")
TEXT("  AddOn: /Game/Path/To/FNA_SomeAddOn.FNA_SomeAddOn_C\n")
TEXT("    AddOnProperty: value\n")
TEXT("  AddOn: /Game/Path/To/FNA_AnotherAddOn.FNA_AnotherAddOn_C\n")
TEXT("    AnotherProperty: value\n")
TEXT("```\n\n")
TEXT("- Each `AddOn:` line starts a new addon block scoped to the current node\n")
TEXT("- Addon properties are indented with 4 spaces (same rules as node properties)\n")
TEXT("- Multiple addons can be attached to a single node - each gets its own `AddOn:` line\n")
TEXT("- The class path must be the full Blueprint-generated class path ending in `_C`\n")
TEXT("- See the **Available AddOns** section for all addon types and their properties\n\n")

TEXT("### Property Values vs Pin Connections (IMPORTANT)\n\n")
TEXT("**PREFER setting property values directly on nodes whenever possible.**\n\n")
TEXT("Many node properties can be set in two ways:\n")
TEXT("1. **Direct property value** (PREFERRED): Set the value directly in the node's Properties section\n")
TEXT("2. **Pin connection**: Wire a data pin from another node to provide the value\n\n")
TEXT("**When to use direct property values:**\n")
TEXT("- The value is **known at design time** (e.g., static text, fixed numbers, asset references)\n")
TEXT("- The value is **constant** and doesn't change during execution\n")
TEXT("- The value is **simple** and doesn't require computation\n\n")
TEXT("**When to use pin connections:**\n")
TEXT("- The value is **computed or generated** by another node (e.g., spawn location, actor ID)\n")
TEXT("- The value is **dynamic** and cannot be predicted at design time\n")
TEXT("- The value needs to be **passed between nodes** as part of the flow logic\n\n")

TEXT("### Connection Topology Rules (CRITICAL)\n\n")
TEXT("**One output pin can only connect to one input pin.** The importer silently drops any connection that would assign a second target to an already-connected output pin.\n\n")
TEXT("**WRONG - fan-out from a single output pin:**\n")
TEXT("```\n")
TEXT("A.OnInteracted -> B.Increment\n")
TEXT("A.OnInteracted -> C.In        <- silently dropped; A.OnInteracted already has a target\n")
TEXT("```\n\n")
TEXT("**CORRECT - use an intermediate ExecutionSequence to fan out:**\n")
TEXT("```\n")
TEXT("A.OnInteracted -> FAN.In\n")
TEXT("FAN.0 -> B.Increment\n")
TEXT("FAN.1 -> C.In\n")
TEXT("```\n\n")
TEXT("**ExecutionSequence output pin count is fixed by the CDO.** The CDO provides exactly 2 output pins (`0` and `1`). Declaring or connecting a third pin (e.g. `2`) is silently ignored.\n\n")
TEXT("**CORRECT - chain a second ExecutionSequence for a third branch:**\n")
TEXT("```\n")
TEXT("SEQ_A.0 -> X.Spawn\n")
TEXT("SEQ_A.1 -> SEQ_B.In\n")
TEXT("SEQ_B.0 -> Y.Spawn\n")
TEXT("SEQ_B.1 -> Z.Spawn\n")
TEXT("```\n\n")

TEXT("### Common Mistakes to Avoid\n\n")
TEXT("**WRONG**: `NamedProperties: [{PropertyName: \"Name\", PinType: {PinCategory: \"text\"}}]`\n\n")
TEXT("**CORRECT**: `NamedProperties: ((Name=\"Name\",DataPinValue=/Script/Flow.FlowDataPinValue_Text(Values=(\"value\"))))`\n\n")
TEXT("**WRONG**: `MyArray: [1, 2, 3]`\n\n")
TEXT("**CORRECT**: `MyArray: (1,2,3)`\n\n")
TEXT("**WRONG**: `DataPinValue=(FFlowDataPinValue_Text,Values=(\"text\"))`\n\n")
TEXT("**CORRECT**: `DataPinValue=/Script/Flow.FlowDataPinValue_Text(Values=(\"text\"))`\n\n")

TEXT("---\n\n")
